WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:09.020
Shonengahosha's 70th Anniversary Commemoration

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.560
Let's take our stance!

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.730
Тоyohisa!

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:35.700
Retreat!

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.040
Retreat from here, uncle!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.000
Leave it to me from here on.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:44.740
What?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.700
You have to go back to Satsuma as well!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.160
Toyohisa!

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.570
I'd like to go back.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.820
If I were to die, I'd choose to die in Satsuma.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.940
Even if all our troops here and I were to die,

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.120
as long as you alone return to Satsuma,

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:08.420
this battle will be our victory.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.830
Marksmen, take your positions.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.180
Aye!

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.780
The time for you to die is now!

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:30.020
Our enemy is the formidable Red Devils of the Tokugawa's Ii clan.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.320
You couldn't ask for a better adversary.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.700
Now is the time to fight to our death!

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.650
If you let any of them get back alive,

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.620
it'll be the Ii clan's disgrace.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:43.640
My Lord!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.000
Buy more time.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.580
Take them down as fast as possible.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.340
Kill as many as you can.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.000
I'll be waiting for you, Toyohisa!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.760
I'll be waiting for you in Satsuma!

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.050
I'll definitely wait!

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:09.220
I'll never forgive you if you die, Toyohisa!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.820
He's such a good uncle.

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.940
I am really blessed.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:19.520
Now's the time to prove my worth as a warrior.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.500
Load your gun!

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.540
Take your aim.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.120
Fire!

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:29.840
Don't falter!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.140
Charge on!

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:47.830
Splendid.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.280
I, Shimazu <i>Nakatsukasa no Sho</i> Toyohisa,

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.280
Ministry of Central Affairs

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.650
joins the battle!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.670
You're a dead soldier.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.670
I, Ii <i>Hyobu no Sho</i> Naomasa, is here!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.670
Ministry of War

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.340
You have already lost.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.700
Your head will be in my hands.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.240
What nonsense are you spouting, idiot?

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:23.720
I'm not the one who'll lose their head.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:25.840
It'll be you!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.750
Naomasa-sama.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:31.580
My Lord!

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:32.760
Protect our Lord!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.000
Aye!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:40.920
Fine.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.370
T-This man.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.080
Such a fool.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:08.980
You're the fool, Ii <i>Jijuu</i> Naomasa!

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:08.980
Chamberlain

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:15.640
I did it!

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:18.620
My Lord!

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.120
Naomasa-sama!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.320
Retreat!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:45.480
Fall back!

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:46.260
What?

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.000
Retreat!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.370
Wait.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.880
Wait, Naomasa!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.660
Are you trying to mock me?

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.720
Leave your head here.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.520
Leave your head here!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.900
Naomasa!

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.140
I want to go back.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.460
Back to Satsuma.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.020
What?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.370
Shimazu Toyohisa

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.320
Please Wait

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.320
Lunch Break

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.420
Next.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.100
What?

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.400
What's this?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.600
Where is

00:06:36.050 --> 00:06:37.040
this place?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:38.340
Where?

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.160
Who are you?

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.360
Bastard.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:49.020
I am going back to Satsuma!

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.160
I am going back to Satsuma!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.640
Shimazu Toyohisa

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:19.100
Next.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.440
What the hell is this?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:40.320
What is it?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:50.260
What is it, brother? Is he unconscious?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.420
What the hell. He's covered in blood!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:59.220
Hey, you. What's wrong?
Are you okay?

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.140
You, are you okay?

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.000
Brother, this man is <i>earless</i>...

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.060
Demons.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:13.640
I guess it's true that I've gone to hell.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.280
Hey, you!!

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.460
He's not just any unconscious person.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.920
This language... He's a <i>Drifter</i>.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.480
T-Them again?!
W-What do we do?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:30.560
What do we do, you say...
We have to take him to

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.080
the <i>castle ruins</i>.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.220
Heavyyyyy!!

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.680
Why is he so heavy?

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.340
If we don't hurry,

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.660
we'll be in big trouble
if the Lord finds out...

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:00.860
Halt!

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.680
If you go any closer to the castle, I'll kill you!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:08.680
If you turn around, I'll kill you!
If you raise your voice, I'll kill you!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.760
What's your purpose here?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:19.180
He's one of your comrades.
See, he's on the verge of death.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.880
We even carried him
all the way here...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.580
Speak a little
more slower.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.220
I don't understand
and you speak too softly.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.400
If you don't speak slowly,
I'll kill you!!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.700
He's a Drifter
just like you, isn't he?

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.820
Look! Here!

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:35.780
Look!!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:39.480
Leave him there.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:43.860
As usual, I don't get them at all.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.420
That's enough. Let's leave quickly.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.500
We'll be killed if they found out

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:54.080
that we entered the forest
and met the Drifters...

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.020
We have to get home quickly.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.340
A warrior.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.980
From the land of the rising sun?

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.060
Who is he?

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:07.840
What's the matter?

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.940
Some villagers carried an unconscious man here.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:14.820
A person from the land of the rising sun. A warrior of some clan, it seems.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.400
Is he alive?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.320
He's barely breathing but he's still alive.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.740
I see.

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.360
We don't have much medicine but let's treat his wounds.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:29.440
He'll survive if his will to live and luck is strong.

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.280
Just like us.

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:42.540
Amusing isn't it, this transient world.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.160
Тoyohisa!

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:48.660
Tоyohisa.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.980
You got a warrior's head in your maiden battle.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.100
It's great.

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:54.960
A great youngster indeed!

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:55.740
Father.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:56.800
Тоyohisa.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.180
Father!

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.860
Oh, so you woke up.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.400
You're quite a tough guy.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.980
Your wounds are stitched up. You'll die if you move around too much.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.620
Who are you? Who the hell are you?

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.360
Who? I should be asking you that question.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.150
Answer me.

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:25.440
Who and where are you from?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.160
The quince motif crest?

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:31.200
Are you a retainer of the Oda clan?

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.660
A retainer?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.900
Are you a fool?

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.720
I am Oda.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.440
Oda is me.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.400
Who the hell are you?!

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.320
I am Nobunaga.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.880
Oda <i>Saki No Ufu</i> Nobunaga.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:54.180
That was dangerous, you fool.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.780
You're the fool.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.780
Note: Nobunaga was known as a fool when he was younger.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.320
Nobunaga, is it?

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.360
Nobunaga's been dead for a long time.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.560
Therefore, this must be the netherworld.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.240
You must be a demon of the netherworld

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.940
pretending to be Nobunaga!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.300
Stop it.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.680
So you've woken up.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.820
This is good news.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:33.560
Start plucking the feathers off.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:34.920
Oh, okay.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:40.440
Are you free?

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:42.140
Yeah.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.860
Start plucking.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:49.620
What is this?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.680
You've mentioned that Nobunaga is dead.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.140
So, people really think I'm dead?

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.280
That's right. He's dead.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:08.160
He was betrayed and killed by Akechi at the Honnouji Temple.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.300
This happened eighteen years ago.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.160
What?!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.480
That's nonsense.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:16.480
Eighteen years ago?

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.100
It hasn't even been half a year

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.600
when that bald bastard attacked me at Honnouji

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.640
and when I was thrown into this world.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:26.480
That's why I said,

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:30.560
you're either a netherworld demon or the dead.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:33.320
If neither, then you're a madman.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:50.440
Making a huge fuss over an insignificant matter like ten or fifteen years is just too comical for me.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.420
And, who might you be?

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.480
Go on and tell him.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.720
I am Yoichi.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.000
Nasu <i>Suketaka</i> Yoichi.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.700
That's a lie!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.260
That name's from the Genpei War.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.440
Note: Yoichi was a famous archer and warrior.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.440
That goes back more than 400 years ago!

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:14.220
Your story is just too absurd!

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.920
No matter how absurd it may sound,

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:22.140
I am who I am.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.960
This must be a dream, no doubts about it.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:27.300
Now.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.600
Who and where are you from?

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:32.800
Shimazu.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.080
I'm Shimazu Toyohisa.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.260
The son of Shimazu Iehisa!

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:38.660
Shimazu?

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:40.560
Who?

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Netherworld

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Glaciers

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Nearly
Uninhabited
Wild-lands

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Provincial Countryside

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Great Civilization

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.900
Countryside

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.900
Final Frontier

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.900
Lawless
No-man
Land

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.900
Land of the Dead

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Nearly
Another
Country

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Devilish
No-man
Land

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:46.320
Shimazu

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.160
Where?

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.320
Countryside

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.320
Final Frontier

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.320
Lawless
No-man
Land

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.320
Land of the Dead

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.220
Where?!

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:46.840
Oh, there it is.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:47.650
Here

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.740
On the very edge of Kyushu.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.520
All the way out in the sticks.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.400
I see.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:52.600
I'll kill you!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:55.380
I know about the Shimazu clan as well.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:58.060
The clan is present even in my time.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.580
It seems they are really from the very edge of Kyushu.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:05.500
So they've come from the countryside from generation to generation.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:06.880
I'll kill all of you.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.820
You'll die if you move around so vigorously.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.740
You've just been stitched up after all.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:14.340
He's a tough guy.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:16.520
Anyway, sit down.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.740
You claimed you're Nobunaga, right?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:21.640
Yes.

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.540
So you didn't die at Honnouji?

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.340
You're supposed to be dead.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.480
You'd think I'll let that bald bastard kill me?

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:36.280
Looking for an escape route, I tried to flee from the temple with Ranmaru.

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.580
You'll never get to kill me, you bastard!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.980
You traitorous bastard!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.580
Suddenly, I found myself in a strange place.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.520
It was a strange hallway paved with stones.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.320
Many doors are lined up on the walls.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:57.620
Right there in the middle was a peculiar man.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.580
It's the same for me.

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.700
I've also met that man.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.040
I've met that man too!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.480
I was in the midst of retreating from the battle of Sekigahara.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.140
Sekigahara?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.520
That place in Mino?

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:17.140
Yeah.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.720
It was a huge battle between the Tokugawa and Ishida forces.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:22.320
Wait.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.000
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:25.940
You mean Ishida the tea server?

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:28.580
Why would Tokugawa battle in such a place?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:29.520
Why?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:32.900
Because the Sengoku Period returned after the <i>Kanpaku</i>'s death.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:34.000
<i>Kanpaku</i>?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.160
Why would a <i>Kanpaku</i> rule over the country?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.160
Note: Kanpaku was a decorative role in Nobunaga's time.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.560
Because the <i>Kanpaku</i> has seized power.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.300
The <i>Kanpaku</i> named Hideyoshi.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:42.840
Hold on!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.720
How'd that bald mouse be able to conquer the country?!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.120
To hell with you! I'm sick of explaining!

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:50.620
He kills Akechi first.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.940
Then he kills Shibata.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:54.260
That's how Hideyoshi took over the country.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.400
K-Katsuie was killed? How about Oichi?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.400
Note: Oichi is Nobunaga's sister and Katsuie's wife.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.600
Brother...

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:58.740
I don't know!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:16:59.580
How's Niwa?

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:00.580
Kazumasu?

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:01.740
And, Тoshiie?

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:03.420
Note: Katsuie, Niwa, Kazumasu and Toshiie were Nobunaga's generals.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.420
How the hell should I know?!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:06.200
The Oda clan is a lowly servant of Ieyasu now!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:08.240
No one cares about <i>Tenka Fubu</i> anymore!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:08.240
Note: <i>Tenka Fubu</i> is Nobunaga's motto for ruling the empire by force.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.540
What?!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.520
How about Nobutada?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.920
What happened to my son?

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:20.560
He's dead.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.140
He was sieged by Mitsuhide in Nijo.

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:30.000
He thought you were dead so he fought to the very end at the castle.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.540
What a foolish son.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:37.840
Such a fool...

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:39.820
A fool...

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.200
He should have just fled.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:53.260
They say a man lives for fifty years.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.380
Were all fifty years of my life been a waste?

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.480
Nothing lasts forever.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:05.500
I was also surprised to learn from Nobunaga-dono that

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:09.160
the Minamoto clan has fallen and the Kamakura shogunate was over.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.400
Since you said you're Nobunaga so,

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.260
when this guy appeared

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.800
I thought he might be the rumored Mori Ranmaru.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:20.380
Note: Ranmaru is rumored to be Nobunaga's lover. Nobunaga: *sparkle* *sparkle*

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.380
It would be great if that is true.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:21.670
Huh?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.940
What are they talking about?

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.480
It's hard to tell from this distance.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.850
Sem, come in.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:34.800
Sem.

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:35.880
How are they?

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:37.400
You got them?

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:38.380
Yes.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.380
They're really Drifters.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.380
All three are together.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.080
It's hard to believe.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.460
We must do something.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.820
If we don't...

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.460
This world will really come to an end.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.480
I've warned both of you so many times!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.320
But you still went to the ruins!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.800
I've told you countless times not to get involved with Drifters!!

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:42.900
Don't go into the forest,
the castle ruins,

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.820
and get involved with Drifters!

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:47.740
If the Lord finds out,
both of you will be killed!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.100
But, he's unconscious and almost dead.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:50.920
No buts!

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:54.980
Listen. Don't get involved anymore.
Do you understand?!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:03.220
Damn, right before harvest...

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.700
Oh well, let's go!!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.420
You've noticed?

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:18.000
What's that?

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:21.140
This smell...

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:24.000
It's the smell of battle.

00:20:30.060 --> 00:20:30.780
It's fire.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:34.120
It seems the elves from the village,

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.160
either the bandits or outlaws,

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.300
are attacking them.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:40.900
It smells like battle.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:42.800
What are elves?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.300
They're the strange people living across the forest.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:47.640
You know,

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.900
the ones with long ears that brought you here...

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:52.400
Hey!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.720
Hey, wait!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:55.700
You're going there?

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:58.480
I have no idea on where and what's happening.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.300
I don't even know if this is a dream or reality.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:04.860
That's why the only thing I can do is face it head on!

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.820
He's a real fool.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.840
And he was just on the verge of death earlier.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.580
He's like a bullet or something.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.240
Are they going to make a move?

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:24.360
Alright!

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:27.400
What are they up to? What's going to happen?!

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:34.940
You're slow.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.040
You're slow, Oda Nobunaga.

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:40.340
What's wrong, Demon King of the Sixth Sky?

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:42.000
Shut up!

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:44.660
I am almost fifty years old now, idiot!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:46.900
How old are you, Тоyohisa-dono?

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:48.340
Thirty.

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:52.020
19

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:55.940
Stop showing your smug face.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:59.480
He's completely different from the Genpei War records.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.280
H-Help!

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:30.340
Hey there, youngsters.

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.000
Leave me your head.

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:49.220
W-Who are you?!

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:51.500
Are you...
a Drifter from the castle ruins?

00:22:52.330 --> 00:22:53.760
I don't understand.

00:22:54.080 --> 00:22:57.020
I don't understand a single word you're saying!

00:22:57.200 --> 00:22:59.400
Speak the land of the rising sun's language.

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:05.960
If you cant speak the language of the land of the rising sun, die!

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:20.940
What strange ears you've got.

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:27.620
You're the ones who saved me, right?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:30.460
Now it's my turn to save you.

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:35.420
Is it alright to leave them alive?

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.700
They don't speak the language of the land of the rising sun too.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:41.750
Shouldn't they die as well?

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:46.100
H-e-l-p.

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:47.540
Repeat after me.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:48.880
H-e-l-p.

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:50.940
Say it!

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:53.040
H-e-l-p. Help!

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:56.320
Help! Help! Help!

00:23:56.980 --> 00:23:57.780
Okay!

00:23:58.840 --> 00:24:00.160
Problem solved.

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.840
That's some crazy persuasion.

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:06.080
It's almost as good as the Ikko-shu's.

00:24:02.880 --> 00:24:06.080
Note: A small religious militant persecuted by Nobunaga.

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:16.240
He's fully equipped with armor.

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:19.770
They're not bandits or wandering outlaws.

00:24:20.380 --> 00:24:21.950
A foot soldier.

00:24:22.330 --> 00:24:24.120
One of the feudal lord's men?

00:24:25.430 --> 00:24:26.420
Fool.

00:24:27.730 --> 00:24:30.040
It's like he's inviting me to attack.

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:36.140
Alright.

00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:37.080
Well then,

00:24:37.720 --> 00:24:39.760
shall we go claim the village.

00:24:41.150 --> 00:24:41.720
Claim?

00:24:42.420 --> 00:24:43.380
Did he say claim?

00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:44.300
Yes.

00:24:45.030 --> 00:24:48.760
Not to take it back or help them but to claim?

00:24:49.880 --> 00:24:52.260
It must have been part of their genes.

00:24:52.980 --> 00:24:55.080
It's the greatest ability they possess.

00:24:55.500 --> 00:24:55.980
Wrong.

00:24:56.640 --> 00:24:58.500
It's the only ability they possess.

00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:04.680
Wherever and whenever they take an action it's always for one sole reason.

00:25:06.400 --> 00:25:08.800
They want to seize power for themselves.

00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:14.840
Line up!!

00:25:21.560 --> 00:25:25.080
What does all this mean,
Aram-sama...

00:25:25.160 --> 00:25:27.740
Have we done anything wrong?

00:25:29.020 --> 00:25:30.400
Elder.

00:25:31.100 --> 00:25:35.460
You've entered the forest
and helped the Drifters, didn't you?

00:25:37.250 --> 00:25:40.800
Elves are strictly forbidden to
enter the forest, make bows,

00:25:41.230 --> 00:25:43.100
and get involved with Drifters.

00:25:44.220 --> 00:25:46.140
Violating that is a grave offense.

00:25:46.580 --> 00:25:51.260
But, the children did that
to save a Drifter who was about to die...

00:25:51.460 --> 00:25:54.480
You're telling me to pardon them just because they're children?

00:25:54.650 --> 00:25:57.220
You elves are really wretched

00:25:57.360 --> 00:25:58.880
and impudent.

00:25:59.240 --> 00:26:01.220
Dealing with the Drifters

00:26:01.390 --> 00:26:03.980
is the job of the <i>Oct</i>'s magicians.

00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:06.940
Therefore, for you demi humans to get near them

00:26:07.200 --> 00:26:09.120
it is a grave offense...

00:26:09.680 --> 00:26:12.120
Did you think that you won't get exposed?

00:26:12.480 --> 00:26:13.730
This is ridiculous!

00:26:13.870 --> 00:26:15.640
You ask the impossible to begin with!

00:26:15.770 --> 00:26:17.730
If we can't enter the forest,

00:26:17.840 --> 00:26:20.220
we can't hunt,
gather firewood or nuts!

00:26:20.420 --> 00:26:22.900
We know nothing about farming
but forced to be farmers.

00:26:23.040 --> 00:26:25.220
You took our women from us.

00:26:25.370 --> 00:26:30.220
And now you're saying it's a crime for children to help a dying man!!

00:26:30.640 --> 00:26:33.730
Are you telling us elves to die?!

00:26:34.260 --> 00:26:37.250
Indeed.
In fact, die immediately.

00:26:38.550 --> 00:26:42.590
If anyone's to blame, it should be
your ancestors who lost the war.

00:26:42.730 --> 00:26:46.180
Soon, you elves,
dwarves, hobbits

00:26:46.290 --> 00:26:50.330
and all demi-humans
will cease to exist...

00:26:50.900 --> 00:26:52.200
Right?

00:26:59.570 --> 00:27:01.100
What are you doing?!

00:27:01.250 --> 00:27:04.540
I'm culling you. How many should die?

00:27:04.920 --> 00:27:08.680
I've been told that reducing half
of your numbers is good.

00:27:13.250 --> 00:27:14.430
Stop it!!

00:27:14.750 --> 00:27:16.900
Kill me! Me!

00:27:17.420 --> 00:27:22.800
I won't kill you. You're still young.
You need to treasure your life.

00:27:22.940 --> 00:27:27.560
After all, you still have a future.
A miserable future as a slave farmer.

00:27:27.900 --> 00:27:31.650
Oh, as for your little brothers
who helped the Drifter,

00:27:31.770 --> 00:27:34.550
they can't be spared
because they're the culprits.

00:27:36.080 --> 00:27:41.400
They must be dead by now...
Becoming the food for bugs in the forest.

00:27:42.810 --> 00:27:44.990
E-Emergency!

00:27:45.300 --> 00:27:46.990
What's the matter?

00:27:47.340 --> 00:27:49.740
The wheat fields are on fire!

00:27:50.460 --> 00:27:51.800
How could this be?

00:27:52.500 --> 00:27:55.090
It hasn't been harvested! It'll impact our tax!

00:27:55.440 --> 00:27:58.060
I have already told you
to keep an eye on it!

00:28:03.560 --> 00:28:05.200
Set the wheat fields on fire?

00:28:05.700 --> 00:28:06.440
Yeah.

00:28:07.160 --> 00:28:11.040
Even without dignity, people can live as long as they have food.

00:28:11.730 --> 00:28:15.900
Even without food, people can endure as long as they have dignity.

00:28:16.700 --> 00:28:20.260
However, if they lose both, then it doesn't matter anymore.

00:28:20.440 --> 00:28:22.300
They'll rely on anything possible.

00:28:23.220 --> 00:28:26.970
This was the tactic used against me that gave me a hell of trouble.

00:28:27.700 --> 00:28:30.520
It's the best strategy to take over the country.

00:28:32.180 --> 00:28:33.640
You're a fearsome man.

00:28:36.830 --> 00:28:39.720
I just love fire.

00:28:40.580 --> 00:28:43.180
It reminds me of Ise Nagashima.

00:28:40.580 --> 00:28:43.180
Note: Ise Nagashima is where Nobunaga set fire and burn 20 thousand people alive.

00:28:56.020 --> 00:28:57.220
The fields...

00:28:57.740 --> 00:29:00.820
Don't just stand there.
Put out the fire!

00:29:00.910 --> 00:29:05.060
It's not possible.
It has spread out too wide...

00:29:06.700 --> 00:29:08.410
Just what is...

00:29:27.640 --> 00:29:28.840
First one down!

00:29:28.910 --> 00:29:29.830
What?

00:29:33.390 --> 00:29:34.770
What was that?!

00:29:35.400 --> 00:29:38.270
What was that earlier?!

00:29:38.400 --> 00:29:40.190
It can't be...

00:29:45.400 --> 00:29:46.800
Second!

00:29:49.050 --> 00:29:50.240
Third!

00:29:52.750 --> 00:29:54.540
Don't panic!! Kill him!!

00:29:58.180 --> 00:29:59.340
Fourth!

00:30:07.500 --> 00:30:09.020
The leader...

00:30:10.150 --> 00:30:11.920
You're the leader, right?

00:30:14.660 --> 00:30:16.040
Leave me your head.

00:30:16.160 --> 00:30:19.140
Hey, you're the leader, aren't you?!

00:30:20.160 --> 00:30:25.650
So this is the drifter...
What nonsense is he spouting?

00:30:26.470 --> 00:30:30.490
So, he is the Drifter!!

00:30:31.080 --> 00:30:32.840
Brother!!

00:30:34.960 --> 00:30:38.920
Маrsha! Маrk!
Both of you are alive!!

00:30:39.340 --> 00:30:43.340
That man...
That scary man saved us.

00:30:43.460 --> 00:30:45.320
That Drifter saved us!

00:30:45.930 --> 00:30:50.580
What's going on...
What's this Drifter thinking?!

00:30:51.470 --> 00:30:54.240
Did you come to stand in my way, Drifter?

00:31:07.080 --> 00:31:08.250
You bastard.

00:31:09.330 --> 00:31:11.200
You must be the bastard who did this.

00:31:15.190 --> 00:31:17.080
I don't want your head anymore.

00:31:17.800 --> 00:31:19.640
Just leave your life behind!

00:31:20.500 --> 00:31:22.920
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:31:23.500 --> 00:31:29.220
If we can't understand each other using our words,
we'll understand each other using our swords.

00:31:29.640 --> 00:31:31.440
Come at me, Drifter.

00:31:32.980 --> 00:31:34.950
Aram's different from the other soldiers!!

00:31:35.320 --> 00:31:41.560
He's a true knight serving the feudal lord.
A mere Drifter can't possibly defeat him!

00:31:48.040 --> 00:31:49.900
I see! You are at a loss!

00:31:50.030 --> 00:31:51.700
How pointless!

00:31:59.730 --> 00:32:01.440
Heave-ho and

00:32:01.440 --> 00:32:02.100
down you go!

00:32:09.100 --> 00:32:11.160
Heh, you're nothing special.

00:32:41.750 --> 00:32:43.360
Using his scabbard...

00:32:43.850 --> 00:32:46.240
It's his freestyle fighting or devotion to win.

00:32:46.820 --> 00:32:48.100
That's brutal.

00:32:49.830 --> 00:32:50.860
Wow.

00:32:51.040 --> 00:32:52.360
He's so scary.

00:32:53.380 --> 00:32:54.500
Have you finished?

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.000
Yeah.

00:32:56.880 --> 00:32:58.340
Those who tried to run away

00:32:58.840 --> 00:32:59.970
has been taken care of.

00:33:01.800 --> 00:33:05.740
He may be scary, but you're scary yourself.

00:33:08.130 --> 00:33:11.600
So, what do you think he will do?

00:33:19.760 --> 00:33:21.920
S-Stop...

00:33:52.080 --> 00:33:52.750
Do it.

00:34:00.420 --> 00:34:01.260
Kill him.

00:34:03.730 --> 00:34:05.560
No, you have to kill him!

00:34:06.000 --> 00:34:06.900
You have to.

00:34:07.100 --> 00:34:08.560
You cannot not kill him.

00:34:09.130 --> 00:34:14.820
No matter the place or your background, you have to be the one to exact the revenge.

00:34:15.300 --> 00:34:17.700
This child is telling you to avenge him!

00:34:20.250 --> 00:34:25.580
They don't understand what was said but they can understand the meaning of his words.

00:34:27.200 --> 00:34:28.700
That guy's something.

00:34:55.720 --> 00:35:00.270
Stop...
All of you, stop...

00:35:00.600 --> 00:35:02.600
Stop it! Stop!!
Stop!

00:35:02.730 --> 00:35:06.430
I admit I'm at fault... Please stop!

00:35:06.560 --> 00:35:09.740
Do you know your consequences
if you do this?!

00:35:10.810 --> 00:35:12.440
Help!

00:35:31.230 --> 00:35:32.140
Good.

00:35:33.180 --> 00:35:34.180
It's good.

00:35:35.640 --> 00:35:36.420
Hiya!

00:35:36.800 --> 00:35:37.400
Huh?

00:35:37.860 --> 00:35:39.440
Where were the both of you?

00:35:39.560 --> 00:35:41.160
I'm still a wounded person here.

00:35:41.500 --> 00:35:43.240
Well, attending to some matters.

00:35:43.630 --> 00:35:44.800
Yes, various matters.

00:35:45.100 --> 00:35:46.320
Leaving that aside...

00:35:46.580 --> 00:35:48.940
You must be tired. Come and have a seat.

00:35:49.400 --> 00:35:53.440
I was thinking of sitting down here at first but I'll let you sit on it instead.

00:35:54.460 --> 00:35:55.060
Hmm?

00:35:56.140 --> 00:35:57.100
This is bad.

00:35:57.340 --> 00:35:58.200
Really bad!

00:35:58.360 --> 00:35:59.560
What a predicament!

00:36:00.150 --> 00:36:02.440
Grand Master, they...

00:36:03.500 --> 00:36:04.480
They have...

00:36:19.960 --> 00:36:22.440
Shimazu Toyohisa
Conquered Elf Village!?

00:36:19.960 --> 00:36:22.440
Oda Nobunaga
Nasu Yoichi

00:36:33.180 --> 00:36:37.320
I see you're still trying to attempt those useless efforts, Murasaki.

00:36:38.180 --> 00:36:40.950
No matter how hard you try

00:36:41.080 --> 00:36:44.560
and no matter how many Drifters you send,

00:36:45.280 --> 00:36:47.600
It'll still be my victory.

00:36:50.600 --> 00:36:55.040
No matter how much effort you put into this, it will all be futile.

00:36:55.750 --> 00:36:57.020
Go away, Easy.

00:36:57.480 --> 00:36:59.580
The mistakes must be corrected.

00:37:03.760 --> 00:37:05.190
Just go away, Easy.

00:37:05.430 --> 00:37:07.320
I won't let you have your way.

00:37:10.200 --> 00:37:11.560
Pitiful woman.

00:37:13.800 --> 00:37:15.680
You're the pitiful one.

00:37:16.500 --> 00:37:18.880
If you can do it then bring it on!

00:37:19.430 --> 00:37:22.300
Black King Begins Conquest of the South

00:37:23.880 --> 00:37:29.860
The likes of your Drifters could not possibly defeat my Ends.

00:37:32.950 --> 00:37:33.840
This is Sem.

00:37:34.080 --> 00:37:34.900
This is Sem!

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:39.000
They have really claimed over the village, Grand Master!

00:37:39.080 --> 00:37:41.400
It's dangerous to leave them alone any longer!

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:43.080
We must send them to you at once!

00:37:43.300 --> 00:37:44.470
No, you mustn't do that.

00:37:44.640 --> 00:37:45.540
You won't make it.

00:37:45.820 --> 00:37:46.980
Don't bring them here.

00:37:47.580 --> 00:37:48.860
You shouldn't come too.

00:37:48.860 --> 00:37:49.460
What?

00:37:49.550 --> 00:37:50.840
Y-You don't mean...

00:37:51.480 --> 00:37:52.260
That's right.

00:37:52.620 --> 00:37:53.600
It has begun.

00:38:05.580 --> 00:38:07.160
It has already begun!

00:38:11.180 --> 00:38:12.680
La Pucelle d'Orléans

00:38:12.680 --> 00:38:14.200
Makoto

00:38:12.680 --> 00:38:14.200
Note: Flag carried by the Shinsengumi.
